16. Complete Terraform workflow – Classroom practical
End-to-end Terraform execution
1. Prepare configuration
   terraform fmt -recursive
2. Initialize providers
   terraform init
3. Validate configuration
   terraform validate
4. Create execution plan
   terraform plan -out=gopal.tfplan
5. Deploy Azure resources
   terraform apply gopal.tfplan
6. Verify resources
   terraform state list
   terraform output
7. Inspect state
   terraform show
   terraform state pull
8. Destroy resources when finished
   terraform plan -destroy
   terraform destroy

